  "body": "## What changed\n\n`AGENTS.md`, \"Testing\", has a new bullet:\n\n> **New tests join a directory suite.** Add a new integration test to an\n> existing domain directory suite (`tests/<suite>/<submod>.rs`) before you\n> make a new top-level test binary (#3187).\n> - The suites in `ISOLATED` (`xtask/src/lanes.rs`) and `SLOW_BINARIES`\n>   (`xtask/src/plan.rs`) are exempt. They must stay separate binaries.\n> - A new top-level file in `crates/*/tests/` needs a one-line reason in the\n>   PR body.\n> - Why: each test binary of `camcraft-app` is about 100 MB. The count of\n>   test binaries went from 412 to 1,020 in ten days.\n\nOther changes:\n- `AGENTS.md`, \"Code shape\": one line that points to the new rule.\n- `.claude/agents/PR-reviewer.md`, step 6, Placement bullet: check (d). A new top-level file under `crates/*/tests/` needs the one-line reason in the PR body, or it must belong to `ISOLATED` or `SLOW_BINARIES`. If not, the reviewer requests a change. No heading changed.\n- `docs/decisions/3187-directory-suite-rule.md`: the decision entry.\n\n## Decision\n\nOwner's decision (live answer in the question dialog, 2026-11-23, relayed by the main session and recorded by the coordinator in a comment on #3187): \"YES, add it.\" The question was: add the rule \"a new integration test joins an existing directory suite\", with the exemptions `ISOLATED` and `SLOW_BINARIES`?\n\nThe directory-suite support in `cargo xtask` is on main (#3186, #3706).\n\n## Tests\n\nThe text of `AGENTS.md` and `PR-reviewer.md` is pinned by xtask tests. After the merge of `origin/main` (build fix `8f60c1f8e`, Gate-map fix `9ff5013f0`), `cargo test -j 6 -p xtask -- --test-threads=6` is green:\n- unit tests of the binary: 316 passed, 0 failed;\n- `catalog` 4, `docs_images` 4, `example_line_endings` 3, `merge_ready_skill` 3, `release_site_tests` 3, `review_artifacts` 3, `post_merge_concurrency` 2, `post_merge_report` 1, `post_merge_stall` 1: all passed.\n\nNot exercised: no heavy lane (the diff is text only). `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` is not edited. No existing test file is converted to a suite.\n\nChangelog: none\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #3187\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\n",
